、鼻子、双颊和嘴巴。色块位于照片最上层，覆盖范围内的刘海和发丝也一并涂住，不得重新绘制在色块上方。面部完整遮盖的优先级高于局部发丝保留。\n色块内部为单一纯色，无五官、纹理、明暗或渐变。遮盖范围以外的头顶、两侧及后方头发保持原样，耳朵、颈部、服装和配饰正常保留。色块是平面涂抹效果，不是面具。侧面全身照、背面全身照及右侧正面特写均不添加色块，保持正常人物细节。\n参考图未展示的服装背面与侧面结构，依据已有设计合理补全，保持统一。\n柔和均匀的专业影棚布光，真实自然的皮肤纹理与服装质感，细节清晰，高分辨率。所有视图周围均为一致的纯白背景。画面干净，无文字、标签、色卡、标尺或水印。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#2a6041", "size": [722.4566040039062, 329.2733459472656], "pos": [982.1114501953125, -1690.2830810546875], "id": 75, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "unknown", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 16}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [56], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Cinematic night street photograph: a model in an exaggerated balloon-sleeve white wool coat walking toward camera under a huge illuminated theatre marquee, the marquee bulbs spelling \"MOSS\" in tall capital letters, wet asphalt with long reflections, warm tungsten glow against cold blue night, anamorphic flare, 35mm film grain, low angle"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 87, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 129, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true, "disabled": false}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [376.5635986328125, 347.1707763671875], "pos": [562.716064453125, -299.8846740722656], "id": 29, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.42.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 25}, {"outputs": [{"name"